WEBVTT

00:04.270 --> 00:07.440
The shining time...

00:08.610 --> 00:16.160
...I have always imagined.

00:25.120 --> 00:30.250
Something will change tomorrow.

00:32.340 --> 00:38.640
I can sense it.

00:39.810 --> 00:46.940
In a mirage, I wait until you come.

00:47.190 --> 00:54.860
I walk briskly through the brightly lit streets.

00:55.780 --> 01:01.870
You've run so far.

01:02.950 --> 01:10.130
So I felt the air of your love.

01:10.340 --> 01:16.340
Soon after I see you,

01:17.680 --> 01:23.640
my stolen heart beats.

01:44.830 --> 01:51.460
The Masked Man! Who Is the Real One?

01:52.130 --> 01:53.300
Want to go somewhere?

01:53.300 --> 01:54.510
I'm hungry.

01:54.510 --> 01:55.210
Okay!

01:55.760 --> 01:59.220
H-Hey, everyone! Wait up! Wa--

02:00.140 --> 02:05.180
What do you want, Class President? I'm in a hurry!

02:05.180 --> 02:08.190
Um... We'll be cleaning the school courtyard tomorrow.

02:08.190 --> 02:13.900
So, those who would like to help, um...

02:13.900 --> 02:14.690
Let's go to the mall!

02:14.690 --> 02:15.990
Sure!

02:15.990 --> 02:16.820
All right!

02:16.820 --> 02:20.110
E-Excuse me, pl... please listen...

02:20.110 --> 02:22.240
The History report...

02:22.240 --> 02:24.040
I'm listening!

02:24.040 --> 02:25.540
I can't hear you!

02:25.540 --> 02:30.080
S-Sorry... Well, those who have yet to turn in their World History report...

02:30.080 --> 02:33.090
...please do so by the end of the week, and...

02:33.090 --> 02:34.340
...umm...

02:34.340 --> 02:36.340
There's more?

02:36.340 --> 02:37.880
We'll be late for our clubs!

02:37.880 --> 02:39.840
Hurry it up, Class President!

02:39.840 --> 02:41.260
I think that's enough.

02:41.260 --> 02:44.850
...and the PTA meeting, uh, so...

02:46.470 --> 02:47.930
Hey! You guys!

02:53.690 --> 02:55.320
Just be quiet, everybody.

03:02.370 --> 03:06.330
It irritates me to look at people like the Class President.

03:06.330 --> 03:08.200
You don't have to go that far.

03:08.200 --> 03:10.710
Why can't he just be more confident?

03:10.710 --> 03:13.540
It can't be helped. That's just the way he is.

03:13.540 --> 03:19.010
It CAN be helped! He just needs to show some effort. That's all it takes!

03:19.010 --> 03:20.550
Isn't that right?

03:21.260 --> 03:25.300
Leaving that aside, I think Chiaki is SO handsome!

03:25.300 --> 03:28.680
He's the man of my dreams. He has guts!!

03:29.890 --> 03:31.600
It's so pretty.

03:32.230 --> 03:36.360
So different from the other guys...

03:36.360 --> 03:37.980
He's the best!

03:37.980 --> 03:40.650
Hey, Maron! Are you listening to me?

03:40.650 --> 03:43.410
Isn't it just an act?

03:44.820 --> 03:49.160
Like when the Class President was having trouble with the class...

03:49.160 --> 03:51.750
I don't think it has anything to do with guts.

03:52.420 --> 03:55.880
Maron, you just don't know Chiaki's real side.

03:55.880 --> 04:00.090
Yes, exactly! I don't know, and I'm happy not knowing!

04:00.090 --> 04:01.550
Hey! I was only--

04:05.260 --> 04:09.310
I'm not asking for an instant change. It's the feeling...

04:09.310 --> 04:12.440
What I'm saying is... Huh?

04:12.440 --> 04:14.600
Look at that...that picture.

04:14.600 --> 04:15.610
Kijyutsushi

04:14.600 --> 04:15.610
Magician

04:15.610 --> 04:17.520
Kijyutsushi magician?

04:20.070 --> 04:22.110
Speaking of a magician...

04:24.660 --> 04:27.070
Doesn't it look just like the Class President?

04:27.070 --> 04:28.030
You think so?

04:28.030 --> 04:29.490
Look closely...

04:31.500 --> 04:33.960
I'm sorry! I'm sorry...!

04:33.960 --> 04:35.580
Class President?

04:36.500 --> 04:38.460
Kusakabe-san, Toudaiji-san...

04:38.460 --> 04:39.840
Is this yours?

04:41.300 --> 04:43.630
This is about magic, right?

04:44.550 --> 04:47.510
Yes. It's my hobby, although I'm not very good at it.

04:47.510 --> 04:50.100
Hobby? It's kinda odd.

04:50.100 --> 04:54.600
When I was a kid, I couldn't distinguish between magic tricks and wizards.

04:54.600 --> 04:58.310
I always thought that I could grant any wish.

04:58.980 --> 05:01.820
You wouldn't happen to still think so?

05:03.740 --> 05:06.860
Now, I know that it's only a trick, but...

05:07.910 --> 05:08.950
But...

05:08.950 --> 05:09.580
But?

05:10.280 --> 05:14.290
...But I think it'd be nice to entertain people.

05:14.290 --> 05:16.250
Really?! That's wonderful!

05:16.250 --> 05:17.960
Hey, can you show us something?

05:18.960 --> 05:20.750
To see how good you are.

05:20.750 --> 05:24.130
But it's probably not worth seeing...

05:24.130 --> 05:25.220
You can't?!

05:25.220 --> 05:26.300
But...

05:26.300 --> 05:30.140
But what? Are you going to do it or not? Say it clearly!

05:30.140 --> 05:31.470
Yes, ma'am!

05:32.060 --> 05:37.310
I know that there's a problem with my personality. Honestly...

05:37.310 --> 05:40.860
...I want to have a different personality.

05:40.860 --> 05:42.280
Then why don't you?

05:42.280 --> 05:46.820
But I can't change that quickly. I just can't help it.

05:46.820 --> 05:49.320
It's not impossible.

05:49.320 --> 05:52.080
They key is to believe in yourself.

05:52.080 --> 05:54.200
You can worry about things after that.

06:02.090 --> 06:04.300
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

06:04.300 --> 06:06.670
I'm sorry...

06:07.970 --> 06:11.470
You know, Class President, you shouldn't apologize so much.

06:11.470 --> 06:13.560
You really are an interesting person.

06:13.560 --> 06:18.440
What? I'm...interesting?

06:18.440 --> 06:19.650
Yeah.

06:20.980 --> 06:23.690
Is that so... I'm interesting?

06:30.870 --> 06:33.870
Hurry up! You're making everyone wait!

06:33.870 --> 06:35.370
Hey! Your ribbon!

06:36.080 --> 06:38.750
I keep saying you don't have to wait.

06:45.550 --> 06:48.970
Aside from Miyako, why were you waiting too, Chiaki?

06:48.970 --> 06:51.800
Why do you think?

06:51.800 --> 06:52.680
Hey...

06:54.140 --> 06:58.480
There's someone like Maron who doesn't think being late is embarrassing.

06:59.190 --> 07:02.480
Good morning, Maron-san... Miyako-san.

07:02.480 --> 07:04.610
- Nagoya-kun, too.

07:03.440 --> 07:04.610
- Good morn--

07:04.610 --> 07:05.940
Who's that?

07:05.230 --> 07:05.940
Dunno...

07:07.570 --> 07:09.110
Where are your glasses?

07:09.110 --> 07:10.450
I decided to wear contacts.

07:11.160 --> 07:12.780
Chiaki, is he your friend?

07:12.780 --> 07:16.040
Don't joke around. It's me, Minazuki Yamato.

07:16.040 --> 07:17.450
What?!

07:22.170 --> 07:25.250
This is how it's done.

07:25.250 --> 07:28.880
I think it's easier and smarter to do it this way.

07:30.220 --> 07:31.840
Still...

07:31.840 --> 07:33.010
What?

07:33.010 --> 07:35.680
Uh, never mind.

07:37.770 --> 07:39.230
Next, Nagoya!

07:39.230 --> 07:40.230
Yes!

07:52.150 --> 07:53.660
Next, Minazuki!

07:59.120 --> 08:02.120
What's wrong, Minazuki? Too hard for you?

08:02.120 --> 08:05.750
He can't jump it unless you make it a lot lower!

08:07.040 --> 08:10.920
Okay! Nagoya, adjust it down by two.

08:10.920 --> 08:11.760
Yes, sir.

08:11.760 --> 08:15.390
Actually, could you raise it by two?

08:15.390 --> 08:17.050
It's harder to jump when it's too low.

08:18.600 --> 08:22.100
- Our Class President seems kind of strange today...

08:20.100 --> 08:22.100
- Someone stop him. He might hurt himself.

08:23.100 --> 08:24.690
Forget it, Minazuki!

08:24.690 --> 08:25.650
You're gonna get hurt!

08:30.480 --> 08:31.820
Unbelievable!

08:31.820 --> 08:33.820
That's amazing!

08:44.500 --> 08:45.580
Excuse me.

08:45.580 --> 08:47.460
- Pardon me.

08:46.080 --> 08:47.460
- Excuse me.

08:48.540 --> 08:50.090
I'll carry those for you.

08:51.420 --> 08:54.340
You've changed, Class President. I'm surprised.

08:54.340 --> 08:55.840
It wasn't all me...

08:57.140 --> 09:00.970
I realized after I spoke with you guys...

09:00.970 --> 09:02.980
...that this is the real me.

09:05.640 --> 09:07.060
"The real you...?"

09:07.060 --> 09:10.650
Yes. I just couldn't bring it out.

09:12.070 --> 09:13.360
Um...

09:13.360 --> 09:15.990
Do you hate me like this?

09:16.610 --> 09:18.200
Not at all.

09:20.870 --> 09:22.160
I'm relieved.

09:22.160 --> 09:24.790
Minazuki-kuuuuuuun!

09:25.410 --> 09:26.920
It's time!

09:28.250 --> 09:30.920
They asked me out for lunch.

09:30.920 --> 09:31.750
See ya.

09:32.340 --> 09:34.260
Too obvious...

09:35.170 --> 09:36.550
Those girls, I mean.

09:37.300 --> 09:39.800
They're treating him completely differently.

09:39.800 --> 09:43.430
But the Class President did become really cool.

09:43.430 --> 09:50.690
Just changed from glasses to contacts... Got smart, athletic and kind...

09:50.690 --> 09:53.070
"Just?"

09:53.070 --> 09:56.150
Well, I do admit that he is cooler now than he was before.

09:56.150 --> 09:57.740
- I don't.

10:00.910 --> 10:02.540
I don't approve of it.

10:02.540 --> 10:06.290
People can't change so easily.

10:07.500 --> 10:10.130
There might be some kind of trick behind all of this.

10:10.130 --> 10:11.750
A trick?

10:18.340 --> 10:20.970
Notice

10:18.340 --> 10:20.970
Don't go away!

10:18.340 --> 10:20.970
I'll return right after these messages!

10:18.340 --> 10:20.970
Kaitou Jeanne

10:21.890 --> 10:24.470
Notice

10:21.890 --> 10:24.470
I'm back to continue my adventures

10:21.890 --> 10:24.470
Kaitou Jeanne

10:32.900 --> 10:36.440
Now, where is that school Maron attends?

10:44.790 --> 10:46.620
Huh? A Demon?

10:47.580 --> 10:49.120
That boy?

11:32.540 --> 11:35.630
This is terrible! I have to tell Maron!

11:35.630 --> 11:37.840
What are you doing?!

11:40.840 --> 11:45.800
<i>Fin, where did you go with the Petit Claire?!</i>

11:49.770 --> 11:51.690
Fin...!

11:56.820 --> 11:58.820
Where did she go?

11:58.820 --> 12:00.490
- Are you looking for something?

12:02.530 --> 12:05.370
Oh, good morning. It's nothing, really.

12:05.370 --> 12:06.740
I'll help you.

12:06.740 --> 12:08.040
You don't have to.

12:11.870 --> 12:13.460
W-What the...?

12:13.460 --> 12:15.500
Let's go, Minazuki-kun.

12:15.500 --> 12:17.630
Please go on ahead without me.

12:18.550 --> 12:21.760
You told me that you'd help us with our homework!

12:21.760 --> 12:23.800
That's right. I was looking forward to it!

12:23.800 --> 12:25.260
Don't worry about me.

12:25.260 --> 12:27.050
That won't be necessary.

12:27.050 --> 12:28.470
Eh?!

12:28.470 --> 12:30.680
But you promised!

12:30.680 --> 12:33.100
Be quiet, both of you!

12:34.190 --> 12:35.440
O-Okay...

12:35.440 --> 12:36.610
See you later, then...

12:36.610 --> 12:37.520
Is that okay with you?

12:37.520 --> 12:41.820
Yes. They don't know anything.

12:41.820 --> 12:43.990
Don't worry about them.

12:43.990 --> 12:45.610
That sounds cold.

12:45.610 --> 12:46.990
Let me say it again:

12:47.950 --> 12:51.870
Their existence means nothing to me.

12:51.870 --> 12:53.210
Class President!

12:54.330 --> 12:55.370
You've changed...

12:55.830 --> 12:57.630
Thanks to you, Maron-san.

12:58.750 --> 12:59.840
Thanks to me?

13:03.550 --> 13:05.470
C-Class President...

13:06.220 --> 13:07.680
Class President...!

13:08.850 --> 13:10.760
Class President, stop it!

13:12.060 --> 13:12.890
No.

13:13.980 --> 13:17.400
The Class President I know doesn't do things like this!

13:17.400 --> 13:19.270
I just <i>couldn't</i>, even if I had wanted to.

13:19.820 --> 13:20.940
Stop it!

13:21.820 --> 13:24.570
Maron-san, I...

13:24.570 --> 13:25.860
No!

13:27.240 --> 13:29.160
Ouch!

13:32.160 --> 13:35.710
Don't flirt so early in the morning.

13:35.710 --> 13:36.710
Chiaki!

13:36.710 --> 13:39.840
Flirting? Is that what they were doing...?

13:41.380 --> 13:43.130
Was my help not needed?

13:43.130 --> 13:44.630
What are you talking about?!

13:45.220 --> 13:47.590
Choose a more appropriate place next time.

13:47.590 --> 13:50.800
That's the most basic of the basics, Class President.

13:50.800 --> 13:52.510
Don't be ridiculous!

13:52.510 --> 13:56.140
Nagoya-kun is right. That was my mistake.

13:57.520 --> 13:58.690
I won't give up.

14:02.610 --> 14:04.360
I won't thank you!

14:05.190 --> 14:08.530
I didn't do it to save you, anyway.

14:08.530 --> 14:09.570
Why, then?

14:10.950 --> 14:13.700
Becaus I liked the former Class President.

14:15.250 --> 14:16.160
Former?

14:16.160 --> 14:21.630
That's right. Even though he was weak, it was his true self.

14:25.550 --> 14:27.920
<i>This isn't how the Class President used to be.</i>

14:37.060 --> 14:40.900
Excuse me! I, Kusakabe Maron, have a headache, so I need to be excused from class!

14:42.310 --> 14:45.280
Nagoya Chiaki! My stomach aches, so I need to also be excused from class!

14:46.570 --> 14:49.780
And... And then as I was following Fin-chan...

14:49.780 --> 14:53.080
Forget about that. Did you find the target?

14:53.080 --> 14:55.330
I'm on it!

14:55.950 --> 14:58.580
<i>Haruta, what's the situation outside?</i>

14:58.580 --> 15:01.130
Everything's fine and the guards are in place.

15:01.130 --> 15:04.420
Okay. Don't even let a mouse enter.

15:04.420 --> 15:05.590
<i>Roger.</i>

15:05.590 --> 15:08.220
Dad, is it Jeanne again?

15:09.130 --> 15:13.140
There was a notice that she will steal the picture on the bottom floor.

15:13.140 --> 15:14.100
That picture...

15:14.100 --> 15:15.930
No, no! I can't let you through.

15:15.930 --> 15:19.310
Miyako-san, this student asked to see you.

15:19.310 --> 15:21.810
Class President, what are you doing here?

15:21.810 --> 15:24.730
I heard that the picture was targeted and got worried.

15:25.690 --> 15:29.530
That picture is my dream, so please let me help.

15:29.530 --> 15:31.110
I promise I won't get in the way.

15:32.860 --> 15:34.660
I can't let you.

15:40.830 --> 15:42.210
Everything's fine.

15:45.000 --> 15:46.670
There are a lot of guards.

15:46.670 --> 15:50.010
Yeah. No one can get past these guards.

15:57.760 --> 15:59.520
Let's go, Fin!

15:59.520 --> 16:00.430
Okay.

16:07.270 --> 16:10.070
<i>Jeanne d'Arc, lend me your power.</i>

16:20.750 --> 16:22.710
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

16:22.710 --> 16:24.580
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

16:24.580 --> 16:26.210
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

16:36.890 --> 16:38.010
She fell for it.

16:51.610 --> 16:53.900
All right! Jeanne is surrounded!

16:53.900 --> 16:55.160
Leave it to me!

16:55.160 --> 16:57.280
Sir, the plan is a success.

16:57.280 --> 16:59.450
We will now capture Jeanne.

17:00.990 --> 17:02.290
Well done!

17:06.460 --> 17:09.590
Damn it! Jeanne got away!

17:09.590 --> 17:10.750
What?!

17:21.310 --> 17:23.640
Welcome to the Magic Show.

17:24.310 --> 17:25.640
Are you planning to stop me?

17:25.640 --> 17:26.600
Stop you?

17:27.810 --> 17:30.270
I'm just going to have you help me with the show.

17:33.360 --> 17:36.200
Observe these cards!

17:50.880 --> 17:52.460
Next, with this rope...

17:53.300 --> 17:55.630
This rope is alive.

17:56.220 --> 17:57.970
What are you going to do with that?

17:59.050 --> 18:01.140
What do you want me to do with it?

18:01.140 --> 18:04.560
Do you realize that you're being controlled by a Demon?

18:05.270 --> 18:06.430
A Demon?

18:06.430 --> 18:10.270
You aren't your true self now. You're a fake!

18:10.270 --> 18:12.940
You're wrong! I'm the real thing!

18:12.940 --> 18:16.610
I am who I wished to be.

18:16.610 --> 18:21.120
That's a lie! A wish is only granted to those who work hard towards it!

18:21.120 --> 18:24.950
Right now, you're just wearing a thin mask!

18:24.950 --> 18:27.290
No! NO!!!

18:29.830 --> 18:31.920
I AM ME!!!

18:31.920 --> 18:35.300
- That's the phrase of those who don't know themselves!

18:40.680 --> 18:41.760
<i>Checkmate!</i>

18:44.560 --> 18:45.720
What?

18:52.360 --> 18:53.270
Jeanne!

18:56.440 --> 18:59.400
Damn it! The picture wasn't the target!

19:03.240 --> 19:05.200
What are you going to do?

19:05.200 --> 19:08.790
Why didn't we realize that the Demon is in something else?

19:09.370 --> 19:12.750
Don't worry, Fin. I promise I will <i>Checkmate</i> it.

19:17.800 --> 19:19.300
<i>I feel it here.</i>

19:21.430 --> 19:24.720
Welcome to the Magic Show, Part Two!

19:34.770 --> 19:38.490
I'm sure it's hiding somewhere around here.

20:01.170 --> 20:02.470
<i>I found it!</i>

20:03.550 --> 20:06.430
I will take off your mask!

20:10.600 --> 20:13.190
So you can smile with your true self!

20:16.820 --> 20:17.690
<i>Checkmate!</i>

20:34.920 --> 20:36.670
<i>Collection completed!</i>

20:37.790 --> 20:42.260
Umm... about the World History report...

20:42.260 --> 20:44.260
The due date is today... so...

20:44.260 --> 20:47.850
- Those who still haven't turned it in, please do so.

20:47.010 --> 20:47.850
- Here!

20:50.310 --> 20:52.480
Kusakabe-san?

20:52.480 --> 20:53.480
Oh?

20:53.480 --> 20:55.100
Aren't you wearing contacts?

20:55.100 --> 20:56.690
It <i>is</i> Kusakabe-san.

20:56.690 --> 20:58.650
What did you do with them?

20:59.270 --> 21:02.610
Well, they didn't quite fit right, so...

21:02.610 --> 21:06.360
What about your glasses? Why don't you wear those?

21:07.200 --> 21:08.450
But...

21:08.450 --> 21:10.160
...But what?

21:10.160 --> 21:16.000
But do you like guys with glasses?

21:16.000 --> 21:20.550
What are you talking about? I like your glasses.

21:20.550 --> 21:23.050
What?! Y-You do?

21:23.050 --> 21:25.300
Yes. That's because they fit you perfectly.

21:25.300 --> 21:27.220
T-They do?

21:31.260 --> 21:34.020
I like Class President's glasses...

21:34.430 --> 21:36.690
I like Class President's...

21:37.230 --> 21:39.060
I like the Class President!<i></i>

21:47.740 --> 21:48.570
Be quiet!

21:53.660 --> 21:56.540
Right now, I have an announcement to make.

21:56.540 --> 21:58.000
The World History report...

22:05.470 --> 22:11.300
For billions of years,

22:11.390 --> 22:20.860
it kept infinite thoughts.

22:23.020 --> 22:29.490
It wakens the memory of the distant past.

22:29.740 --> 22:35.790
A life born in the wild ocean.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.210
The huge mountains...

22:41.920 --> 22:48.840
...emitted white smoke and covered the Sun.

22:49.340 --> 22:53.890
It took everything.

22:56.140 --> 23:02.110
On the deserted land with you,

23:02.190 --> 23:09.110
we watched the world ending...

23:09.320 --> 23:15.160
Someday we'll go beyond space-time...

23:15.290 --> 23:24.960
and I'll wish to meet you again.

23:32.640 --> 23:40.770
It is I, the disgraceful Haruta, who recklessly let a robber escape in front of his eyes.

23:40.770 --> 23:42.020
Haruta-san...

23:42.020 --> 23:43.520
What should I do, Miyako?

23:43.520 --> 23:48.900
I know! If that's the case, I'll just go and arrest Jeanne, Sinbad and the robber all at once!

23:48.900 --> 23:51.860
It's no time to cry... Let's go Haruta-san!

23:51.860 --> 23:55.490
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne: Ah, the Beautiful Heart of an Officer

23:55.490 --> 23:59.290
I, Haruta, will catch the criminal for sure this time!
